{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spellers is a chaotic team-based magical brawl inspired by <strong>Minecraft Sheepwars</strong> where wizards cast all sorts of spells. Up to 15 players (or bots in private matches) sling ridiculous spells in PvP and PvE arenas. Mix <strong>20+ spells</strong> in wild combos \u2013 maybe you\u2019ll rocket into the sky, trap your friends in ice, or \u201caccidentally\u201d explode the entire battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wardrobe of Wizardry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/137f0feb6e4a6af316248cb543471b21.poster.avif?t=1752591503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/137f0feb6e4a6af316248cb543471b21.webm?t=1752591503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/137f0feb6e4a6af316248cb543471b21.mp4?t=1752591503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Customize your wizard with unlockable robes, hats, and wands earned through battle. Whether you\u2019re dressing like a battlefield commander or a magical clown, everything you wear has to be earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spells Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/017e272a2bfb1eb83c76551c2280d038.poster.avif?t=1752591503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/017e272a2bfb1eb83c76551c2280d038.webm?t=1752591503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/017e272a2bfb1eb83c76551c2280d038.mp4?t=1752591503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Control the battlefield by combining 20+ spells to outplay, outcast, and out-blast your enemies. Build walls, trap opponents, teleport behind them, or use knockback spells to toss them off the map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Different Kind of Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/aed7333771cda7e2034d2ce3630fba08.poster.avif?t=1752591503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/aed7333771cda7e2034d2ce3630fba08.webm?t=1752591503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/extras/aed7333771cda7e2034d2ce3630fba08.mp4?t=1752591503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in 3v3 matches, free-for-alls, or take on bots in PvE arenas. Up to 15 players or bots per match, with plenty of ways to customize the rules. Crank up health, lower gravity, make spells do double damage, or let everyone jump across the map.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1933010?t=1752591503","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1933010?t=1752591503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/f4c151d529c20183a46b197565ca010ffec77e9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752591503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1933010/f4c151d529c20183a46b197565ca010ffec77e9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752591503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LA